## Step 8 — Sensitivity proportion figures (R)

Sensitivity proportions were visualized as grouped bar charts with SD error bars and individual replicate points overlaid, using a consistent color palette across conditions (gold #E69F00, grey #999999, navy #1B3B6F). See `08_figure_scripts/` for the complete figure generation scripts.

Key scripts:

- `nucleosome_sensitivity_H2AZ_final.R` — shScr vs shH2AZ, dual y-axis (proportion left axis, nucleosome count right axis)
- `nucleosome_sensitivity_HP1_dualaxis.R` — shScr vs shHP1α vs shHP1β, patterned bars (solid / stripe / crosshatch via ggpattern)
- `nucleosome_sensitivity_all_dualaxis.R` — all four conditions combined
- `nucleosome_distribution_barplot.R` — repositioning and occupancy changes as % of total genes (n = 21,054)

